OL,3,GNEWSAJuvenile arthritis will not stop
OL,4,Asports-mad Alfie
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We thought it was just growing pains
OL,7,Fbut we knew there was something wrong
OL,8,Fwhen it stopped him playing football."
OL,10,FWhen Alfie, then aged seven, began to
OL,11,Flimp his parents, and initially his GP,
OL,12,Fbelieved it was a normal part of his
OL,13,Fchildhood.
OL,15,FBut when the problem did not clear up,
OL,16,Fhe underwent a series of tests, which
OL,17,Fdiagnosed juvenile idiopathic arthritis
OL,18,F(JIA).
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
