OL,3,GNEWSAJuvenile arthritis will not stop
OL,4,Asports-mad Alfie
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow nine, Alfie is back playing his
OL,7,Fbeloved sports but his mother, Laura,
OL,8,Fsaid: "It's a bit of an invisible
OL,9,Fdisease and not many people know about
OL,10,Fit - so keep asking those questions."
